{
  "name": "Dinero IA — Smoke Test v1 (sin video, valida imágenes + voz)",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveExecutionProgress": true,
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all"
  },
  "tags": [
    { "name": "dinero-ia" },
    { "name": "smoke-v1" }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1600, 0],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "RSS — Bloomberg Línea",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedRead",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1400, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://www.bloomberglinea.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/?outputType=xml",
        "options": { "ignoreSSL": false }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Limit 1 item (test)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.limit",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1200, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "maxItems": 1
      },
      "notes": "Smoke test: solo 1 item para validar. Después de validar, sumamos volumen."
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Normalize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-1000, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "1", "name": "title", "value": "={{ $json.title }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "2", "name": "url", "value": "={{ $json.link }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "3", "name": "snippet", "value": "={{ $json.contentSnippet || $json.content || '' }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "4", "name": "brief_id", "value": "={{ $now.toMillis() }}", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "A3 — Brief + Script + Image Prompts (Opus 4.6)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [-800, 0],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "text": "=Item para procesar como pieza Dinero IA:\n\nTítulo: {{ $json.title }}\nURL: {{ $json.url }}\nSnippet: {{ $json.snippet }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "Sos el director editorial de Dinero IA — marca LATAM sobre IA × Finanzas Personales (modelo Mis Propias Finanzas + Pequeño Cerdo Capitalista). Educativo, NO asesoría.\n\nVoz: viral hype calibrado. Hook emocional + body sobrio. Disclaimer obligatorio si productos.\n\nTu tarea: convertir este item en TODO el paquete listo para producción de un reel de 35-45 segundos.\n\nGenerá JSON exacto (sin markdown, sin ```):\n\n{\n  \"title\": \"<título reel>\",\n  \"sub_categoria\": \"<inversiones|presupuesto|inflacion|impuestos|comparativas|retiro|crypto|bancos|otros>\",\n  \"score_filter\": <0-10 — score de qué tan apropiado es este item para Dinero IA. Si <6 reportar 'descartar' en title>,\n  \"script\": \"<texto plano del script para narración — 110-130 palabras, ~40s a 170 WPM. Español neutro LATAM. Hook 0-3s + contexto + valor + disclaimer corto al final>\",\n  \"caption_ig\": \"<caption IG max 800 chars con hook + 1 frase de valor + disclaimer + 7-10 hashtags>\",\n  \"caption_tiktok\": \"<caption TikTok max 150 chars + 3-5 hashtags>\",\n  \"hook_tentativo\": \"<frase corta del primer 3s>\",\n  \"disclaimer_requerido\": <true|false>,\n  \"productos_mencionados\": [\"<si aplica>\"],\n  \"keyframes\": [\n    {\n      \"index\": 0,\n      \"text_overlay\": \"<texto que aparece en el frame — corto, max 8 palabras>\",\n      \"image_prompt\": \"Editorial design composition, 1024x1792 vertical 9:16. Dark charcoal background hex #0D1117. Inter Bold text in pure white #FFFFFF reading exactly: '<TEXTO DEL FRAME>'. Golden accent #D4A574 only on numbers or key words. JetBrains Mono caption bottom-right: 'DINERO IA'. Minimalist editorial style, no faces, no cartoons, generous negative space.\"\n    },\n    {\"index\": 1, \"...\": \"...\"},\n    {\"index\": 2, \"...\": \"...\"},\n    {\"index\": 3, \"...\": \"...\"},\n    {\"index\": 4, \"...\": \"...\"}\n  ]\n}\n\nGenerá EXACTAMENTE 5 keyframes: 1 hook + 3 body + 1 disclaimer (si disclaimer_requerido=true).\n\nCada image_prompt debe ser COMPLETO y autosuficiente (que gpt-image-2 lo entienda sin contexto adicional)."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "Opus 4.6",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [-800, 200],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-opus-4-6",
        "options": { "temperature": 0.5, "maxTokensToSample": 4000 }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "anthropicApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_ANTHROPIC_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Anthropic Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
      "name": "Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-660, 200],
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"title\", \"sub_categoria\", \"score_filter\", \"script\", \"caption_ig\", \"caption_tiktok\", \"hook_tentativo\", \"disclaimer_requerido\", \"keyframes\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"title\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"sub_categoria\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"score_filter\": {\"type\": \"number\"},\n    \"script\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"caption_ig\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"caption_tiktok\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"hook_tentativo\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"disclaimer_requerido\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"},\n    \"productos_mencionados\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}},\n    \"keyframes\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"index\", \"text_overlay\", \"image_prompt\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"index\": {\"type\": \"number\"},\n          \"text_overlay\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"image_prompt\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008",
      "name": "Score >= 6?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-500, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "score-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.output || $json).score_filter }}",
              "rightValue": 6,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gte" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009",
      "name": "Discarded notice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-260, 200],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "8780791028",
        "text": "=🟡 Dinero IA — item descartado (score < 6)\n\nTítulo: {{ ($('A3 — Brief + Script + Image Prompts (Opus 4.6)').item.json.output || $('A3 — Brief + Script + Image Prompts (Opus 4.6)').item.json).title }}\nScore: {{ ($('A3 — Brief + Script + Image Prompts (Opus 4.6)').item.json.output || $('A3 — Brief + Script + Image Prompts (Opus 4.6)').item.json).score_filter }}/10\nURL: {{ $('Normalize').item.json.url }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_TELEGRAM_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Telegram - Dinero IA"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
      "name": "Extract data + flatten keyframes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-260, -200],
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.item.json.output || $input.item.json;\nconst brief_id = $('Normalize').item.json.brief_id;\nconst url = $('Normalize').item.json.url;\n\n// Output: array of items, one per keyframe — for splitInBatches loop\nconst out = data.keyframes.map(kf => ({\n  json: {\n    brief_id,\n    source_url: url,\n    title: data.title,\n    script: data.script,\n    caption_ig: data.caption_ig,\n    caption_tiktok: data.caption_tiktok,\n    hook_tentativo: data.hook_tentativo,\n    disclaimer_requerido: data.disclaimer_requerido,\n    sub_categoria: data.sub_categoria,\n    keyframe_index: kf.index,\n    text_overlay: kf.text_overlay,\n    image_prompt: kf.image_prompt,\n    total_keyframes: data.keyframes.length\n  }\n}));\n\nreturn out;"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
      "name": "Loop keyframes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [-40, -200],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012",
      "name": "OpenAI — gpt-image-2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [200, -300],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/images/generations",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"gpt-image-1\",\n  \"prompt\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.image_prompt) }},\n  \"n\": 1,\n  \"size\": \"1024x1536\",\n  \"quality\": \"high\",\n  \"output_format\": \"png\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "json" } },
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_OPENAI_CRED_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI - Dinero IA"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Modelo gpt-image-1 (endpoint actual OpenAI). Si gpt-image-2 está activo en tu cuenta, cambiar a 'gpt-image-2' en jsonBody."
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000013",
      "name": "Decode base64 image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [440, -300],
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.item.json;\nconst b64 = data.data?.[0]?.b64_json;\nif (!b64) {\n  throw new Error('No b64_json in OpenAI response: ' + JSON.stringify(data).slice(0, 200));\n}\nconst buffer = Buffer.from(b64, 'base64');\nconst loopItem = $('Loop keyframes').item.json;\n\nreturn {\n  json: { ...loopItem, image_size_bytes: buffer.length },\n  binary: {\n    data: {\n      data: b64,\n      mimeType: 'image/png',\n      fileName: `keyframe_${loopItem.keyframe_index}.png`\n    }\n  }\n};"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000014",
      "name": "Upload image to Supabase Storage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, -300],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://xmidoxxtjpifvebxnfva.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/dinero-ia-assets/keyframes/{{ $json.brief_id }}/{{ $json.keyframe_index }}.png",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "image/png" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "binaryData",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {
          "response": { "response": { "neverError": true, "responseFormat": "json" } }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_SUPABASE_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Supabase - Dinero IA"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000015",
      "name": "Get signed URL image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [920, -300],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://xmidoxxtjpifvebxnfva.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/dinero-ia-assets/keyframes/{{ $('Decode base64 image').item.json.brief_id }}/{{ $('Decode base64 image').item.json.keyframe_index }}.png",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"expiresIn\": 86400\n}",
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "json" } } }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_SUPABASE_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Supabase - Dinero IA"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Genera URL firmada válida 24h. Lo necesitamos porque el bucket es privado y Telegram no tiene acceso a Supabase."
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000016",
      "name": "Pass result back to loop",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1160, -300],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "1", "name": "keyframe_index", "value": "={{ $('Decode base64 image').item.json.keyframe_index }}", "type": "number" },
            { "id": "2", "name": "text_overlay", "value": "={{ $('Decode base64 image').item.json.text_overlay }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "3", "name": "signed_url", "value": "=https://xmidoxxtjpifvebxnfva.supabase.co/storage/v1{{ $json.signedURL }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "4", "name": "brief_id", "value": "={{ $('Decode base64 image').item.json.brief_id }}", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000017",
      "name": "ElevenLabs — TTS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [200, 0],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/text-to-speech/lJtjZw9ZjSbD9Zs9bOWq",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
            { "name": "Accept", "value": "audio/mpeg" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"text\": {{ JSON.stringify(($('A3 — Brief + Script + Image Prompts (Opus 4.6)').item.json.output || $('A3 — Brief + Script + Image Prompts (Opus 4.6)').item.json).script) }},\n  \"model_id\": \"eleven_multilingual_v2\",\n  \"voice_settings\": {\n    \"stability\": 0.55,\n    \"similarity_boost\": 0.75,\n    \"style\": 0.35,\n    \"use_speaker_boost\": true\n  }\n}",
        "options": {
          "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "file" } },
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_ELEVENLABS_CRED_ID",
          "name": "ElevenLabs - Dinero IA"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Voice ID hardcoded en URL (lJtjZw9ZjSbD9Zs9bOWq). Si querés cambiar voz, editá la URL."
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000018",
      "name": "Upload audio to Supabase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://xmidoxxtjpifvebxnfva.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/dinero-ia-assets/voice/{{ $('Normalize').item.json.brief_id }}/narration.mp3",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "audio/mpeg" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "binaryData",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {
          "response": { "response": { "neverError": true, "responseFormat": "json" } }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_SUPABASE_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Supabase - Dinero IA"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "name": "Get signed URL audio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://xmidoxxtjpifvebxnfva.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/dinero-ia-assets/voice/{{ $('Normalize').item.json.brief_id }}/narration.mp3",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"expiresIn\": 86400\n}",
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "json" } } }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_SUPABASE_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Supabase - Dinero IA"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000020",
      "name": "Collect all (after loop)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1400, -100],
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "// Collect all keyframes from loop output + audio data + brief data\nconst keyframes = $('Pass result back to loop').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst audioUrl = `https://xmidoxxtjpifvebxnfva.supabase.co/storage/v1${$('Get signed URL audio').item.json.signedURL}`;\nconst brief = $('A3 — Brief + Script + Image Prompts (Opus 4.6)').item.json.output || $('A3 — Brief + Script + Image Prompts (Opus 4.6)').item.json;\nconst source_url = $('Normalize').item.json.url;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    brief,\n    keyframes,\n    audio_signed_url: audioUrl,\n    source_url\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000021",
      "name": "Format Telegram message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1620, -100],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "=💰 *Dinero IA — Smoke Test*\n\n*Título:* {{ $json.brief.title }}\n*Sub-categoría:* {{ $json.brief.sub_categoria }}\n*Score:* {{ $json.brief.score_filter }}/10\n\n*Hook:* _{{ $json.brief.hook_tentativo }}_\n\n*Script ({{ $json.brief.script.split(' ').length }} palabras):*\n{{ $json.brief.script }}\n\n*Caption IG:*\n{{ $json.brief.caption_ig }}\n\n*Disclaimer req:* {{ $json.brief.disclaimer_requerido ? 'sí' : 'no' }}\n\n*🎨 Imágenes ({{ $json.keyframes.length }}):*\n{{ $json.keyframes.map((k, i) => '• Frame ' + i + ': ' + k.signed_url).join('\\n') }}\n\n*🔊 Audio (24h válido):*\n{{ $json.audio_signed_url }}\n\n*📰 Fuente:* {{ $json.source_url }}\n\n_Las URLs expiran en 24 horas. Click para ver/escuchar._",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000022",
      "name": "Telegram — Send Preview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1840, -100],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "8780791028",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_TELEGRAM_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Telegram - Dinero IA"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
